me=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\" /></svg>\n                  Private capsule pod with door\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\" /></svg>\n                  Free WiFi, A/C, personal locker\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\" /></svg>\n                  Shared kitchen & laundry access\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            {/* Monthly */}\n            <div className=\"bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-700 text-center relative\">\n              <div className=\"absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-amber-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                Best Value\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 mb-2\">Monthly Stay</div>\n              <div className=\"flex items-baseline justify-center gap-1 mb-4\">\n                <span className=\"font-display text-5xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">RM594</span>\n                <span className=\"text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 ml-1\">/month</span>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mb-2 space-y-1\">\n                <div className=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\">\n                  <span>+ Service Tax (SST) 8%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\">\n                  <span>+ Tourism Tax (TTx): RM10/room/night</span>\n                  <a\n                    href=\"https://www.myttx.customs.gov.my/\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n                    aria-label=\"Learn more about Malaysia Tourism Tax (TTx)\"\n                    className=\"text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-700 dark:hover:text-amber-300\"\n                  >\n                    <svg className=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                      <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                  </a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-sm mb-6\">\n                That&apos;s just RM19.80/night — save over 40% vs nightly rate.\n              </p>\n              <ul className=\"text-left space-y-3 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400\">\n                <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\" /></svg>\n                  Everything in nightly stay\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\" /></svg>\n                  Ideal for remote workers & digital nomads\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\" /></svg>\n                  Flexible start date\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Trust Signals */}\n          <TrustSignals />\n\n          {/* Booking Form */}\n          <div className=\"mt-12 max-w-md mx-auto\">\n            <BookingForm />\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Or divider */}\n          <div className=\"mt-10 flex items-center gap-4 max-w-md mx-auto\">\n            <div className=\"flex-1 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700\" />\n            <span className=\"text-xs font-medium text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-wider\">\n              or pay deposit online\n            </span>\n            <div className=\"flex-1 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700\" />\n          </div>\n\n          {/* FPX Online Banking Payment */}\n          <div className=\"mt-8 max-w-md mx-auto\">\n            <FpxPaymentForm />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      {/* Why Book Direct */}\n      <section className=\"py-16 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900\">\n        <div className=\"container-custom\">\n          <div className=\"text-center mb-12\">\n            <p className=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 mb-3\">\n              Direct Booking Benefits\n            </p>\n            <h2 className=\"font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">\n              Why Book Direct?\n            </h2>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto\">\n            {directBenefits.map((benefit, index) => (\n              <div\n                key={index}\n                className=\"bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-700 transition-colors\"\n              >\n                <div className=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-7 h-7 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                    <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={1.5} d={benefit.icon} />\n                  </svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-2\">{benefit.title}</h3>\n                <p className=\"text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-sm\">{benefit.description}</p>\n              </div>\n            ))}\n          </div>\n\n          {/* OTA vs Direct Savings Comparison Callout */}\n          <div className=\"mt-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-linear-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 dark:from-stone-800 dark:to-stone-800 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-700\">\n            <p className=\"text-center text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 mb-6\">\n              Price Comparison\n            </p>\n            <h3 className=\"font-display text-xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-center mb-6\">\n              Direct vs OTA — What You Actually Pay\n            </h3>\n            <div className=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6\">\n              {/* OTA column */}\n              <div className=\"bg-white/70 dark:bg-stone-900/70 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700\">\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n                  <div className=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-stone-100 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <svg className=\"w-4 h-4 text-stone-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                      <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17H3a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v10a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2\" />\n                    </svg>\n                  </div>\n                  <span className=\"font-medium text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300\">Via Booking.com</span>","numLines":200,"startLine":150,"totalLines":644}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01NexhRy7y6D6Ktr3pQAFzu7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! I found the primary CTA. It's at line 149-160, the \"Book via WhatsApp\" button. The acceptance criteria requires me to:\n\n1. Create Vercel Edge Config store\n2. Install @vercel/edge-config and @vercel/flags packages\n3. Define an A/B flag for the CTA copy\n4. Evaluate the flag in middleware and set variant cookie before page render\n5. Add GA4 custom dimension for tracking\n6. Vercel Flags UI should show status/rollout\n\nHowever, the story was marked as skipped with oversized diffs. I need to make a focused, minimal implementation. Let me create a plan:\n\n## Diagnosis\n\n**Current State:**\n- Book page exists at site/src/app/book/page.tsx with primary CTA \"Book via WhatsApp\"\n- No middleware.ts exists yet\n- No flags.ts exists yet\n- @vercel/edge-config and @vercel/flags not installed\n\n**Problem:**\n- Story US-173 requires A/B testing with Vercel Feature Flags for the CTA copy\n- Previous attempts resulted in oversized diffs (12854 lines > 500 limit)\n- Need minimal implementation that adds variant testing without excessive code\n\n**Planned Changes:**\n1. Install @vercel/edge-config and @vercel/flags packages (package.json update)\n2. Create middleware.ts to read flag and set cookie\n3. Create flags.ts with flag definitions\n4. Update book/page.tsx to read cookie and conditionally render CTA variants\n5. Add GA4 event tracking for variant\n\nLet me check the diff budget before starting. The story was oversized at 12854 lines. I need to be VERY careful to keep this under 350 lines added+deleted.\n\nActually, wait. The story says it was skipped. Let me re-read the instructions. The instructions say:\n\n\"CRITICAL RULE: This is a sub-story broken from a failed parent story. \n\nThe parent story (marked _decomposed: true) should NOT be touched.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5088,"cache_read_input_tokens":71049,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5088},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3712043e-c0e8-41eb-922a-1509bd1ca824","uuid":"0986c8b9-d200-4607-8a86-14d3e51427cd"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01NexhRy7y6D6Ktr3pQAFzu7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Current State\n\nThe book page exists at `site/src/app/book/page.tsx` with a primary WhatsApp CTA button. No middleware, flags infrastructure, or Edge Config integration currently exists. The project has Next.js 16, React 19, and Vercel deployment configured.\n\n## Problem Identified\n\nStory US-173 was previously skipped with oversized diff (12,854 lines, 500 limit). Need minimal A/B testing setup with Vercel Feature Flags that:\n1. Evaluates flag in middleware (server-side)\n2. Sets variant cookie to prevent client-side layout shift\n3. Tracks variant in GA4\n4. Stays under diff budget (~350 lines)\n\n## Planned Changes\n\n- Install `@vercel/edge-config` and `@vercel/flags` packages\n- Create `middleware.ts` (read flag, set cookie)\n- Create `src/lib/flags.ts` (flag definitions)\n- Update `book/page.tsx` (read cookie, render variant CTA)\n- Add GA4 custom dimension event tracking\n\n<plan>\n{\n  \"files_to_create\": [\n    \"site/src/middleware.ts\",\n    \"site/src/lib/flags.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"files_to_modify\": [\n    \"site/package.json\",\n    \"site/src/app/book/page.tsx\"\n  ],\n  \"functions_to_add\": [\n    \"getCtaVariant (middleware)\",\n    \"getCTALabel (flags)\",\n    \"trackVariantDimension (book page)\"\n  ],\n  \"estimated_loc\": 120\n}\n</plan>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5088,"cache_read_input_tokens":71049,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5088},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3712043e-c0e8-41eb-922a-1509bd1ca824","uuid":"fc7eb49a-6067-456c-985b-c7195630760d"}
